    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it’s just this constant weight. like i’m just going through the motions of being a person. i wake up, i go to work, i talk to my family, and i just feel so hollow. it's not even that i'm \"sad\" exactly, it's just that the color is gone from everything. i'm just so tired of waking up to this emptiness every single morning. i just want it to be quiet. i just want the grayness to stop.",
