    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i've talked to people, i've tried the therapist thing... it just feels like it's never going to change. it's like i'm stuck in this room with no windows and the lights are just dimmed forever. i'm just so exhausted from trying to pretend that the emptiness isn't there. sometimes i just wonder... if there was a way to just have some peace. like, to finally have some real stillness instead of this constant, heavy nothingness.",
